      {
        "id": "tb-option-1",
        "moduleId": "polymorphic-dispatch",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "example",
        "title": "教材方案一：按具体类型分列表",
        "markdown": "方案一为每种形状各维护一个列表，依次遍历每个列表并绘制其中对象。教材随即提问：如果新增一种形状，需要改什么？每新增一种形状就要新增列表和遍历代码，已有代码被迫重改。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d998d2c477335adeea4bf2f2",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000052"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Creating Classes",
                " Option 1"
              ],
              "lineStart": 344,
              "lineEnd": 348,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "95b093b61146d28a147883bc9de32ffcbc5b47cbd373b539c4a694ad85ea5a09"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-option-2",
        "moduleId": "polymorphic-dispatch",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "example",
        "title": "教材方案二：统一列表加类型判断",
        "markdown": "方案二只维护一个 `Shape` 引用列表，逐个判断对象的真实类型，向下转型后再调用 `draw()`：遍历 `for every Shape s in myShapeList` 时，若 `s is really a Circle` 就取 `(Circle)s` 并 `c.draw()`，否则继续判断 `Square`。教材同样提问：新增形状时又要改什么？仍然要修改这段分派逻辑。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d998d2c477335adeea4bf2f2",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000053"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Creating Classes",
                " Option 2"
              ],
              "lineStart": 349,
              "lineEnd": 359,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "3264f4d37cc653e8e441be42f5a376049ceec77ea839312d1ffe112a28011955"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-option-3",
        "moduleId": "polymorphic-dispatch",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "example",
        "title": "教材方案三：多态调用",
        "markdown": "方案三只保留一个 `Shape` 引用列表，让编译器/运行时去处理每个 `Shape` 引用：`for every Shape s in myShapeList s.draw();`。教材再次提问：新增形状时需要改什么？答案是不需要修改这段循环。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d998d2c477335adeea4bf2f2",
