      {
        "id": "tb-diamond-problem",
        "moduleId": "interfaces-and-multiple-inheritance",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "warning",
        "title": "教材问题：方法冲突与 dreaded diamond",
        "markdown": "如果两个父类都有 `move()`，继承哪一个？必须补充语法让它明确。更麻烦的是“dreaded diamond”：一个基类有两个子类，而这两个子类又共同成为一个更下方类的父类，UML 中形成菱形。如果中间两个类各自独立覆盖了顶端类的方法，最下方类就会遇到冲突。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d998d2c477335adeea4bf2f2",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000058"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Creating Classes",
                "Multiple Inheritance Problems"
