              "excerptSha256": "6f7ee30f581120f82d51771d7cff5927d1cfaaec0d5d65ca2921cb7eb8d708cb"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-fixing-abstraction",
        "moduleId": "interfaces-and-multiple-inheritance",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "教材结论：抽象化消除冲突",
        "markdown": "如果冲突方法中至少有一个是 abstract，问题就消失了：抽象方法没有实现，也就不存在两个实现相互冲突。",
        "provenance": {
